# Root .gitignore — SATYAM-SCHOOL
# Sub-projects (admin-panel/, mobile-app/) keep their own .gitignore for
# stack-specific build output; this file covers the repo root only.

# AI prep workspace — never production, never shipped (AI PROJECT PROMPT §A.2/§B).
# Planning drafts, coding stubs, debugging notes, suggestions, documentation
# drafts, reusable prompt templates, launcher .bat scripts, and local
# reference material (dashboard screenshots, planning PDFs, source images,
# under Scratch/refdocs/) all stay local-only, untracked — one single rule
# covers all of it. The continuity files (rule book, current-state
# snapshot, session/work logs, specs) live outside this folder entirely —
# see /governance/ (tracked normally, no exception needed here;
# RULEBOOK.md §0.8/§0.9).
/Scratch/

# Real secrets/env files — never tracked, at root or nested
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor/IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
